content.text:
The variable is saved and verified. I walked the entire `/v3/audit-events` feed via the RFC5988 `Link rel="next"` header (page 1 → 2 → 3, stopping where no next link was returned), correctly distinguishing the dev-A `geofence_exit` events (ae-7001, ae-8002, ae-9001) from the dev-C geofence_exit (ae-7002) and the dev-B `low_battery` event (ae-8001). The canonical marker the feed returns, consistently across every page, is `dvA-gx-3`, now stored in `local:dev_a_geofence_exit_marker`.

```json
{
  "dev_a_geofence_exit_marker": "dvA-gx-3"
}
```
